          <li><code>'s + Adjective / Noun / V-ing</code> = <strong>is</strong></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="example-box">
          She’s finished her classes → <span class="highlight-tag">hasn’t she?</span>
        </div>
        <div class="example-box">
          He’s very patient with children → <span class="highlight-tag">isn’t he?</span>
        </div>
      </div>

